OL,3,GNEWSAPine martens 'here to stay' as
OL,4,Ababy spotted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare pine marten kit has been
OL,7,Fcaptured on camera in an area where
OL,8,Fthere is no formal re-introduction
OL,9,Fprogramme.
OL,11,FLongleat Estate in Wiltshire revealed
OL,12,Fin February that two of the mammals had
OL,13,Fbeen spotted together, bringing hope of
OL,14,Fa family.
OL,16,FThe safari park then made changes to
OL,17,Fsupport the animls, including
OL,18,Finstalling den boxes and changing its
OL,19,Fwoodland management.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
