OL,3,GNEWSAPine martens 'here to stay' as
OL,4,Ababy spotted
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's extremely exciting that all that
OL,7,Fwork has resulted in kits, said
OL,8,FLongleat's head of conservation and
OL,9,Fresearch, Dr Tom Lewis. "We now know
OL,10,Fthat they are here to stay and we look
OL,11,Fforward to seeing our population expand
OL,12,Ffurther in the future."
